      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1007 - Abdullah ibn Sinan narrated from Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) that He said:\n\"If you forget something in the prayer, whether it is bowing, prostration, or takbir, and then remember it, make up for what you missed due to forgetfulness”."
        ]
